      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know... i've tried everything. but it's just so exhausting to exist like this. i look at people living their lives and i just feel like an alien. it's like i'm constantly paying a tax just for being alive, and i'm just broke. i'm so done with the struggle. i just want everything to stop. i just want some peace.\n Balance the energy of the user against the idea of peace and stopping.  Todes",
